lore = "A banana peel found in King Fisher's trash can. It has small traces of King Fisher’s saliva. He (presumably) ate said banana while (presumably) holding said banana peel. The price for items interacted with by King Fisher have been skyrocketing recently, thus, it was sold for an unspeakable amount of money and donated to the tournament.

To each their own I guess."

